<title>USA: Clinton offers disaster aid to Ohio and Kentucky.</title>
<headline>Clinton offers disaster aid to Ohio and Kentucky.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>President Clinton, while touring tornado damage in his home state of Arkansas, made disaster aid available Tuesday to parts of Ohio and Kentucky suffering from floods.</p>
<p>The White House said the action affected 14 counties in Ohio and nine counties in Kentucky.</p>
<p>Assistance will include temporary housing and low-cost loans to cover uninsured property losses.</p>
</text>
